      "The 4 Days Kilimanjaro Short Trek via Machame route is referred as Special Kilimanjaro Climbing challenge to get to the summit for shortest period of time. It is NOT more affordable than a 6 days Kilimanjaro hike but it is a challenge for most fit hikers. So this itinerary is designed for Mountaineers as a Kilimanjaro Climb Challenge.",
